WEBVTT

00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:00.768
This is what death is.

00:11:00.792 --> 00:11:05.309
You can reach into the coffin and touch.

00:11:05.333 --> 00:11:09.809
And those protocols
allow you to do things.

00:11:09.833 --> 00:11:11.601
So for instance,

00:11:11.625 --> 00:11:14.809
there is a licensing of grief.

00:11:14.833 --> 00:11:19.934
Being angry, tearful, grieving, crying.

00:11:19.958 --> 00:11:23.601
A recognition of irrevocable change

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:27.101
in the very public deadness
of the deceased.

00:11:27.125 --> 00:11:31.309
A communal acknowledgment
of bereavement and loss.